Package: rustd-resolved
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Native DNS resolver for RustD
 rustd-resolved provides DNS, mDNS, LLMNR, caching, and per-link routing
 through RustD-native services and Varlink interfaces.
